@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
hide footbox
title Family scan: successful execution path
participant "scan_family\nCLI" as CLI
participant "DuckDB\nrepositories" as Data
participant "FamilyRisk\nAnalyzer" as Risk
participant "Family\nAnalyzer" as Family
participant "Skill\nAnalyzer" as Scanner
participant "compare_results\nfunction" as Compare
CLI -> Data : load(name)
Data --> CLI : artifacts
CLI -> Data : load(artifact IDs)
Data --> CLI : sibling records
CLI -> Risk : analyze(artifacts, sibling_files)
activate Risk
Risk -> Family : analyze(artifacts)
Family --> Risk : family graph
loop selected directed edges
  Risk -> Scanner : scan uncached skill bodies
  Scanner --> Risk : skill profiles
  Risk -> Compare : compare_results(base, derived)
  Compare --> Risk : category flags; rule deltas
  opt changed sibling state
    Risk -> Scanner : scan uncached sibling text
    Scanner --> Risk : sibling profiles
    Risk -> Compare : compare sibling aggregates
    Compare --> Risk : rule deltas
    Risk -> Risk : collect sibling findings;\nrecord incomplete coverage
  end
  Risk -> Risk : collect positive skill deltas
end
Risk --> CLI : findings and coverage
deactivate Risk
CLI -> CLI : write or print report
note over CLI, Compare
  Cache hits reuse existing profiles; ambiguous edges are not scanned.
  Dataset instructions are scanned as text, never executed.
end note
@enduml
